    "## 11. SOTA Deep Learning Models Overview\n",
    "\n",
    "### 11.1 N-BEATS (Neural Basis Expansion Analysis)\n",
    "\n",
    "N-BEATS is an interpretable deep learning model that:\n",
    "- Uses monotonic neural units for interpretable components (trend, seasonality)\n",
    "- No feature engineering required\n",
    "- Works well for univariate time series\n",
    "- Can be extended to multivariate forecasting\n",
    "\n",
    "```python\n",
    "# Production implementation with NeuralForecast\n",
    "from neuralforecast.models import NBEATS\n",
    "\n",
    "model = NBEATS(\n",
    "    batch_size=32,\n",
    "    n_epochs=50,\n",
    "    lr=0.001,\n",
    "    num_blocks=5,\n",
    "    num_layers=3,\n",
    "    hidden_size=64,\n",
    "    loss=MSELoss(),\n",
    ")\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### 11.2 Temporal Fusion Transformer (TFT)\n",
    "\n",
    "TFT is a state-of-the-art deep learning model that:\n",
    "- Handles static covariates, known future inputs, and observed past inputs\n",
    "- Uses attention mechanisms for interpretability\n",
    "- Provides multi-step ahead probabilistic forecasts\n",
    "- Excellent for hierarchical forecasting\n",
    "\n",
    "```python\n",
    "# Production implementation with GluonTS\n",
    "from gluonts.model.tft import TFTEstimator\n",
    "\n",
    "tft = TFTEstimator(\n",
    "    prediction_length=horizon,\n",
    "    hidden_size=16,\n",
    "    lstm_layers=2,\n",
    "    num_attention_heads=4,\n",
    "    loss=StudentTLoss(),\n",
    ")\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### 11.3 DeepAR\n",
    "\n",
    "DeepAR (from GluonTS) is a probabilistic autoregressive model:\n",
    "- Uses RNN to learn temporal dependencies\n",
    "- Models full probability distribution\n",
    "- Naturally provides prediction intervals\n",
    "- Scales well to many time series\n",
    "\n",
    "```python\n",
    "# Production implementation\n",
    "from gluonts.model.deepar import DeepAREstimator\n",
    "\n",
    "deepar = DeepAREstimator(\n",
    "    prediction_length=horizon,\n",
    "    seq_length=52,\n",
    "    context_length=26,\n",
    "    num_bands=10,\n",
    "    dropout_rate=0.1,\n",
    ")\n",
    "```"
   ]
